OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAnother cold start with a risk
OL,6,Fof frost in places. It will remain dry
OL,7,Fand settled during the day with
OL,8,Flengthy sunshine and light winds.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FDry through the evening with
OL,11,Flengthy clear spells. It will stay dry
OL,12,Fovernight with some frost in places
OL,13,Fagain and some fog patches developing.
OL,14,
OL,15,CMonday:FA chilly but largely sunny
OL,16,Fmorning with an early frost in places.
OL,17,FClouding over from the southeast from
OL,18,Flate morning with the odd spot of
OL,19,Flight rain possible later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
